# T-010 AEAT PoC — NEVER commit certificate/key material or credentialed payloads
# (RGPD surface, even against preproducción). The harness reads the cert from an
# env-injected local path; nothing secret belongs in the tree.
poc/aeat-preproduccion/secrets/
poc/aeat-preproduccion/captured/
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
*.cer
*.crt
